    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44195" root="&#xA;                        نول&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَالٌ</span></b> 
                         and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَائِلٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَالٌ</span></b>  (K) <i>A gift:</i>
(S, K:) and <i>a benefit, or favour, obtained from
a man.</i> (TA.) See two exs. of the first voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِرْقٌ</span>: and an ex. of the second voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَبَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَالٌ</span> is also used as an inf. n. See an ex.,
from El-Aashà, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ</span>.

